$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tmillen  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lean's ` listLen_runs ` at the machine: wherever ` listLen x y s z ` is installed, from any state with the list ` ( encListB ` L ) ` (entries of at most ` B ` bits, fewer than ` 2 ^ B ` of them) on ` x ` it pushes the count on ` y ` and restores every other stack (~ tm2llen at the concrete handlers, the counter the installed ` incr ` , ~ tmiincs ).

